; error: 6:43: cannot assign to immutable variable 'n'; this lambda keeps 'n' as 'bind& n', which only reads it, and one that changes it keeps it as 'hold& n'
; A place kept as 'fixed&' is only read.
task main()
    flex n = 1
    region r
    fixed f = [fixed& n, @r]() -> nothing n = 2 fi
    f()
fi
